### Books - User endpoints
### Run each request by clicking the ▶ next to "###" (Android Studio / IntelliJ).

@host = http://localhost:8080

### List all users
GET {{host}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Get a user by id
GET {{host}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Get a non-existent user (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/users/9999
Accept: application/json

### Create a user (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nathalia",
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "token": "tok-123",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Create another user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@poatek.com",
  "token": "tok-999",
  "password": "johndoe456"
}

### Try to create a duplicate user (409 Conflict - same email/token)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Someone",
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "token": "tok-123",
  "password": "whatever"
}

### Update a user (200 - updates name/email; password optional)
PUT {{host}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nathalia Santos",
  "email": "nathalia.santos@poatek.com",
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

### Delete a user (204 - soft delete, sets deleted=true)
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/1

### Restore a deleted user (200 - deleted=false)
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/restore

### Block a user (200 - blocked=true)
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/block

### Unblock a user (200 - blocked=false)
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/unblock

### Successful login (200 - returns the token)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Invalid sign-up (400 - invalid email + short password + empty name)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "token": "tok-xyz",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login with wrong password (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### Login of a blocked user (403 Forbidden - run after /block)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}
